{#- The band across the head of a page: a picture, a video or what the page
    puts there — an animation —, cropped to the band, the glow of a
    placeholder while there is none. Its words over its foot when it has
    some: a title, a line under it.

    src: a picture; video: a video, playing muted, looping, in the band.
    alt: what the picture shows.
    title, subtitle: the words over the band's foot.
    height: the band's (--cover-height).

    A page puts its own animation in the band by embedding it:
        {% embed '@WexampleSymfonyDesignSystemBundle/components/cover/cover.html.twig' %}
            {% block cover_media %}<canvas class="cover--fill"></canvas>{% endblock %}
        {% endembed %} -#}
<div class="cover media--placeholder{{ class|default(null) ? ' ' ~ class }}"
    {%- if height|default(null) %} style="--cover-height: {{ height }}"{% endif %}>
    <div class="cover--media">
        {%- block cover_media -%}
            {%- if video|default(null) -%}
                <video class="cover--fill" src="{{ video }}" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true"
                    {%- if src|default(null) %} poster="{{ src }}"{% endif %}></video>
            {%- elseif src|default(null) -%}
                <img class="cover--fill" src="{{ src }}" alt="{{ alt|default('') }}">
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- endblock -%}
    </div>
    {%- if title|default(null) or subtitle|default(null) -%}
        <div class="cover--words">
            {%- if title|default(null) %}<h1 class="cover--title">{{ title }}</h1>{% endif -%}
            {%- if subtitle|default(null) %}<p class="cover--subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</p>{% endif -%}
        </div>
    {%- endif -%}
</div>
